，一言難盡，每個人吃有不同感受吧！男店員感覺端不太動麵，整個碗傾斜到湯在碗的邊緣在一厘米就要流出來了。女店員很親切熱情，工作盡責（地面油油的用紙巾擦，而不是拖把，有觀念很棒），但聲音有點大聲，用餐中常常被嚇到。",null,[0,41]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZUZsWVNsSldWRTQxWkZWS1dWbHJkREpqTVdNMFpVWTVUVkZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZUZsWVNsSldWRTQxWkZWS1dWbHJkREpqTVdNMFpVWTVUVkZ1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZUZsWVNsSldWRTQxWkZWS1dWbHJkREpqTVdNMFpVWTVUVkZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZUZsWVNsSldWRTQxWkZWS1dWbHJkREpqTVdNMFpVWTVUVkZ1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZUZsWVNsSldWRTQxWkZWS1dWbHJkREpqTVdNMFpVWTVUVkZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZUZsWVNsSldWRTQxWkZWS1dWbHJkREpqTVdNMFpVWTVUVkZ1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,5789,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21weFlYSlJWVE41ZFVKWVlrdDJjMWM0ZUY5TVFuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfb4d765a274a7fda!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmpxYXJRVTN5dUJYYkt2c1c4eF9MQnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21weFlYSlJWVE41ZFVKWVlrdDJjMWM0ZUY5TVFuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21weFlYSlJWVE41ZFVKWVlrdDJjMWM0ZUY5TVFuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21weFlYSlJWVE41ZFVKWVlrdDJjMWM0ZUY5TVFuYxILMGRTNDhlZkNSOHcaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tcHhZWEpSVlRONWRVSllZa3QyYzFjNGVGOU1RbmMSCzBkUzQ4ZWZDUjh3IhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR2n9KJ1p2TfsqCzBkUzQ4ZW