ING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwiw3M6j8tSWAxUrZPUHHYeiChIQ3IcHCNgCKAk",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwiw3M6j8tSWAxUrZPUHHYeiChIQ3IcHCNkCKAo",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiw3M6j8tSWAxUrZPUHHYeiChIQ3YcHCNsCKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwiw3M6j8tSWAxUrZPUHHYeiChIQ3IcHCNoCKAs",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiw3M6j8tSWAxUrZPUHHYeiChIQ3YcHCN0CKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiw3M6j8tSWAxUrZPUHHYeiChIQ3IcHCNwCKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["平日下午2:00，見無人排隊，便又去吃碗麵，炸雞皮及炸蓮藕。先說好的。我點的是招牌湯拉麵，叉燒很大塊，料滿多的雞白濃湯也不錯，不過最致命的是不夠熱。料放到口中是比常溫更低的溫度，喝一啖料邊的湯，再喝一啖較底層的湯，溫度明顯有分別，應該是凍料把面頭的湯都給冷凍了。 說說雞皮，店員捧來的時候還叫我小心燙，讓我以為真的是即炸般熱，吃一口，原來也只不過是常溫，不夠熱不夠脆的炸雞皮，剩下的就只有油膩感。然後是炸蓮藕。第一口我還以為這道是沙拉，因為一點都不炸，溫度就像打開便利店的包裝食物。我叫店員確定這不是沙拉，他人很好，給我換了一份。結果，還是不夠熱，但比之前一份好。\n\n總算是來過這家假日人潮排長龍的名店。環境是不錯的，服務也非常殷勤有耐性。 食物的溫度就是要改進的地方。",null,[0,131]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhSZDJKSVNrMVhibHBwVXpKb1EySjZiSEZaTUhneldsZGFNMlZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhSZDJKSVNrMVhibHBwVXpKb1EySjZiSEZaTUhneldsZGFNMlZZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhSZDJKSVNrMVhibHBwVXpKb1EySjZiSEZaTUhneldsZGFNMlZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17984583729565501971/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhSZDJKSVNrMVhibHBwVXpKb1EySjZiSEZaTUhneldsZGFNMlZZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://bu